# --- 3. JavaScript / Frontend Exclusions ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- 4. IDE & Text Editor Cache Metrics ---
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
